business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"p8V4zEEYZvZnZh9f8k5KZA","review_id":"WPbsUOLQP7Ndif5RFVhCuQ","date":"2017-05-19T16:18:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9305247664451599,"text_excerpt":"We went here on Sunday, place was packed. We had the peach flavor, very tasty. People were getting gallon jugs full of daiquiri, love it. I'd recommend this place, just for the fun of it."},{"business_id":"p8V4zEEYZvZnZh9f8k5KZA","review_id":"B63QFG1c1vkAOlSiF1rOug","date":"2012-05-28T13:53:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9254472255706787,"text_excerpt":"Love the daiquiris here -- especially Mardi Gras Mash. So good. The guests here are usually old guys that have no female friends, so they hang here and drink with each other and gawk at the women who come in to get a drink here... But even so, I love daiquiris and this place has a lot of flavors! Good place -- I wish there was a drive thru though."},{"business_id":"p8V4zEEYZvZnZh9f8k5KZA","review_id":"ZvpFoIdHiODuJy9UcEwBwA","date":"2011-12-09T21:08:14","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9223202466964722,"text_excerpt":"Yes it is a little bit cheesy but it is also a New Orleans tradition to get your daquiri on. This is the best location to grab an iconic, icy, tasty beverage before heading off to the Fly for a fun filled afternoon or a Carnival parade. They have some fantastic flavors and you can always add extra shots and get sizes all the way up to a gallon. I personally like to stick with the strawberry so I can delude myself that it is mostly healthy and it isn't packed with a weeks worth of sugar. The biggest negative for this location is there isn't a legendary drive through so you have to walk inside and parking can get pretty crowded around this oddly located building (that can be a bit clumsy to..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"p8V4zEEYZvZnZh9f8k5KZA","photo_id":"ppDijq5j3bqzhjHaR2POWw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ppDijq5j3bqzhjHaR2POWw.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
